      "category": "Text",
      "text": "This is to remind you that the Mayor's Office dis-\ntributes to all departments and agencies appropriate approval\nand disapproval forms for use in reporting on proposed State\nlegislation. Form NYC 55 is used for making favorable\nrecommendations, and Form NYC 56 for suggesting disapproval.",
